Preserve keyboard repeat/keymap metadata before the next input event.

Only reselect a replacement when the old active group loses its last
reference.  Shared active groups and inactive keyboards keep their current
selection.  Do not dereference the old group after unref frees it.

Upstream status: not submitted.

